	"FriendlyName": "Dream Dynamic World",
	"Description": "Systems that make a world feel alive, sharing one set of conventions: a single analytic model evaluated identically on CPU and GPU, camera-following dynamic volumes, and one subsystem per feature that every consumer (materials, Niagara, gameplay, the engine's own systems) reads. Wind ships today (global wind, terrain modulation and wind shadows, dynamic volume, sources and impulses, Niagara DI, presets); water and weather are next.",
